1. **Pins, baseline, worktrees.** Record `date`, two `uptime` reads 4 s apart, `node -v`, `npm -v` (CI uses node 24; the lock is lockfileVersion 3 and B385/B497 wrote it with npm 11.19; if your npm major differs, expect churn, and the key-set check in Proof 4 is what decides), the main sha, `git for-each-ref --format='%(refname) %(objectname)'` to `session-tools/b595/logs/refs-before.txt`, `git worktree list` before, the root checkout's `status --porcelain | wc -l` before and after (equal). Create `worktrees/b595-fix` with `git worktree add -b b595/nexusai-body-parser-audit <path> <main sha>` (the object is local; if not, ONE explicit-refspec fetch into the git directory only, never `--prune`, never a bare fetch; assert `rev-parse HEAD` = the main sha and a clean tree) and `worktrees/b595-base` with `git worktree add --detach <path> <main sha>` (the red-first control tree; nothing in it is ever committed or pushed). `npm ci --no-audit --no-fund` in both (npm 11 does not run install scripts unless approved, B497; say what you saw for `sqlite3`). Baseline verify in `b595-fix` (Proof 5). Red-first (Proof 3) in `b595-base`.
